```mermaid
erDiagram
  USERS ||--o{ MEMBERSHIP : has
  HOMES ||--o{ MEMBERSHIP : has

  HOMES {
    uuid id PK
    boolean active
    uuid owner_id  // single owner (FK -> USERS.id)
  }

  USERS {
    uuid id PK
    text email
  }

  MEMBERSHIP {
    uuid home_id FK
    uuid user_id FK
    timestamp left_at NULL
  }
```

Notes
- Exactly one active owner per home.
- Home.active = true iff owner_id is not null.
- Owner must have MEMBERSHIP with left_at IS NULL.

